              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मूर्छा — mūrchā — \"a faint; a swoon\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "गर्मी से एक आदमी को सड़क पर मूर्छा आ गई। garmī se ek ādmī ko saṛak par mūrchā ā gaī. A man fainted in the street from the heat."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मूर्छा (mūrchā) is a tatsama, borrowed from Sanskrit mūrchā, \"fainting, a swoon, stupor\" (Monier-Williams). mūrchā ānā is to faint; everyday speech often says behoś honā."
            }
          ]
        },
